# RESTRICTED DATA -- do not relax these. Repo-wide backstop for DHS files that land
# outside pipeline/data/; see CLAUDE.md and pipeline/docs/dhs-data-terms-constraints.md.

# Statistical package formats, wherever they land.
*.DTA
*.dta
*.SAV
*.sav
*.SAS7BDAT
*.sas7bdat
*.SD2
*.sd2

# The rest of a DHS recode package (definitions, frequency listings): part of the
# distributed dataset, which the agreement says is not to be shared.
*.DCT
*.dct
*.DO
*.do
*.FRQ
*.frq
*.FRW
*.frw
*.MAP
*.map
*.SPS
*.sps
*.SAS
*.sas

# Extraction leftovers from DHS archives.
*.ZIP
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

